      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TALK TO LEXY (3) has been racing well of late. Kicked off the campaign with back-to-back placings then finished fourth at his latest appearance at Wagga, beaten 3 metres. Should enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position and will be at his peak now. Finds a suitable race and can take this out. BOPPER (8) is back from a break of five months and looks to be right up to the mark following two trials, winning the latest. Put together a string of seconds last time in. Threat if he gets the gaps. CALM LEGEND (1) last appeared when fifth here three months ago. Trialled well and gets the ace draw so look out for any positive market movement. SEND IT SAM (6) draws on the front row for the first time so far this campaign and was good when a close second two back before a solid effort in stronger company last time.",
